Located north of the western road out of the [[Crossroads]], the '''Forgotten Pools''' are the northernmost of the oases in the [[Barrens]]. As with many of these verdant pools, it is patrolled by [[Kolkar]] [[Centaur]] along with the indigenous wildlife, such as [[turtle]]s.

